<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern, conical tail spot-to-ring transition & P1 surface-FEM felid body (African leopard (Panthera pardus) coat rosettes and tapered tail markings)" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/murray-mammalian-coat-markings-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/murray-mammalian-coat-markings-2>,
